From 6f1d00cad37aec9b25730d99741d076472d0a3a4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 14:59:45 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 5/8] Add afdo-tools test support and tests

Add directive-driven DejaGnu coverage for afdo_tools, including shared Python
validators and live, merge, address-mapping, attribution, and profile-apply
tests.  Run each test stem independently to support parallel make check.

Cover CSE source locations and require finalized profiles for every symbol in
an IPA-ICF folded range.

Regression tested on aarch64-linux-gnu with no new regressions.

afdo_tools/ChangeLog:

	* testsuite/afdo-test/cse-source-duplication.c: New test.
	* testsuite/afdo-test/ipa-icf-profile-alias.c: Likewise.

Signed-off-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
---
