From 6e8a34b981b692d822e903e4f29fcefa4ee0addb Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 14:59:48 +1000
Subject: [PATCH 8/8] Teach cc1 to read GCOV AutoFDO profiles

Build libgcovreader.a from the afdo_tools GCOV reader sources and link it
into the GCC backend so auto-profile can consume GCOV v3/v4 profiles
produced by afdo_create:

  - compile afdo-gcov-{io,reader,reader-v3,reader-v4}.o into
    libgcovreader.a
  - drive auto-profile.cc through the shared gcov_reader API
  - add -fauto-profile-format= and -fauto-profile-partial
  - document the options in invoke.texi
  - match PHI arguments on predecessor edges (bb->preds) instead of
    successor edges

Regression tested on aarch64-linux-gnu with no new regressions.

gcc/ChangeLog:

	* Makefile.in (GCOVREADERLIB, GCOVREADER_OBJS): Build
	libgcovreader.a from afdo_tools GCOV reader sources and link it
	into the backend.
	* auto-profile.cc: Read GCOV v3/v4 profiles through
	libgcovreader; build afdo_source_profile from gcov_profile;
	match PHI arguments on predecessor edges.
	* auto-profile.h: Update related declarations.
	* common.opt (fauto-profile-format=, fauto-profile-partial): New
	options.
	* doc/invoke.texi: Document -fauto-profile-format and
	-fauto-profile-partial.
	* flag-types.h (auto_profile_format): New enumeration.
	* system.h: Support INCLUDE_UNORDERED_MAP for the shared reader.

Signed-off-by: Dhruv Chawla <dhruvc@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Kugan Vivekanandarajah <kvivekananda@nvidia.com>
Co-authored-by: Rahul Shinde <rashinde@nvidia.com>
---
 gcc/Makefile.in     |  32 +++-
 gcc/auto-profile.cc | 449 +++++++++++++++++---------------------------
 gcc/auto-profile.h  |   2 +-
 gcc/common.opt      |  24 +++
 gcc/doc/invoke.texi |  29 ++-
 gcc/flag-types.h    |   9 +
 gcc/system.h        |   3 +
 7 files changed, 270 insertions(+), 278 deletions(-)

diff --git a/gcc/Makefile.in b/gcc/Makefile.in
index 8ecef4ccdc7..3bd3d3848d3 100644
--- a/gcc/Makefile.in
+++ b/gcc/Makefile.in
@@ -449,6 +449,11 @@ CPPINC = -I$(srcdir)/../libcpp/include
