+@item -fauto-profile-format=@var{format}
+Select the on-disk format of the AutoFDO profile supplied to
+@option{-fauto-profile}.  @var{format} is one of:
+
+@table @samp
+@item auto
+Detect the format from the file contents.  This is the default.
+@item v3
+The legacy @samp{gcda}-based format written by older @command{create_gcov}.
+@item v4
+The version 4 binary format.
+@item v4-text
+The textual variant of the version 4 format.
+@end table
+
+@opindex fauto-profile-partial
+@opindex fno-auto-profile-partial
+@item -fauto-profile-partial
+Read only the data needed for the translation unit being compiled from a
+version 4 AutoFDO profile, rather than the whole profile.  This can
+substantially reduce the time spent reading large cross-module profiles.  The
+option has no effect for profiles whose format does not support partial reads
+(such as the legacy version 3 format), which are always read in full.
+Disabled by default.
